<xpage:title>Guides for users</xpage:title>
    <xpage:body>
        <div>
            <p>Here you will find a short list of helpful guides that explain how this site helps different potential user groups.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <p>The following guidance is available and can also be accessed from any point in the site from the navigation bar at the top of the page:</p>
            
        <ul>
            <li><a href="/guides/for_students.html">For students</a></li>
            <li><a href="/guides/for_supervisors.html">For supervisors</a></li>
            <li><a href="/guides/for_researchers.html">For researchers</a></li>
            <li><a href="/guides/for_stewards.html">For academic stewards</a></li>
            <li><a href="/guides/for_policy.html">For research policy-makers</a></li>
            <li><a href="/guides/for_industry.html">For industry professionals</a></li>

        </ul>
                     
        <p>All comments and suggestions will be gratefully received.</p>
        </div>

